hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1911","[AI-translation] Abu Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey haan ladka paida hua. To main use Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas laaya. To Aap ne uska naam Ibrahim rakkha. To use khajoor se tehneek ki aur uskey liye barkat ki dua ki aur use mujhey dey diya. (Bukhari: 5467)"
"1912","[AI-translation] Abu Bakr ki beti Asma (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Abdullah bin Zubair ko jana. Wo hijrat ki hadees mein guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan badhaa diya: To wo uskey sath sakht khush huey. Kyunke un se kaha gaya tha ke Yahood ne tum par jaadu kar diya hai aur tumhaarey haan paida na hoga. (Bukhari: 5469)"
"1913","[AI-translation] Dabbi Salmaan bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ladkey key sath aqeeqa hai. To uski taraf se khoon bahaao aur us se takleef door karo. (Bukhari: 5471)"
"1914","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Fara aur Ateera nahi hai. Aur Fara: Pehli paidaish thi jise wo apne buton key liye zibah kartey they. Aur Ateera Rajab mein hai. (Bukhari: 5473). Zabeehon ki kitaab."
